    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Custom ProductRampSegment records on the same product whose date ranges overlap.
Why it matters: Ramp pricing becomes ambiguous — the engine picks one segment, sometimes the other. Customers see different rates billed across periods that should have one consistent rate.
Suppress a finding: never; fix the date ranges.
Disable the detector: leave on.</value></values>
